Description: DBblue - Odoo-tuned PostgreSQL 19 database server
 DBblue is a PostgreSQL 19 fork tuned for Odoo workloads. It bundles an
 incremental materialized view engine, an in-memory columnar accelerator,
 and the pgvector extension, and defaults wal_compression to lz4.
 .
 The server installs under /opt/dbblue/19 and runs as the "dbblue" systemd
 service on port 5432 (listening on localhost by default).

